==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|resorbere|lang=la}}, from {{term|re-||again|lang=la}} + {{term|sorbere||to suck in|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[absorb]] (something) again
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} to undergo [[resorption]]
# {{context|biology|transitive|lang=en}} to [[dissolve]] something (as for example bone, sinew, or suture) and [[assimilate]] it.

